<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-Tenders total A$60 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-Tenders total A$60 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market absorbed A$60 million worth of promissory notes via tenders on Thursday.</p>
<p>International Business Machines Corp sold A$10 million of 120-day paper at three basis points over BBSW and A$20 million of 39-day notes at between two and three basis points over.</p>
<p>At 11.20 a.m. (0020 GMT), March 90-day bank bill futures were trading at 94.10, one point higher on the day.</p>
